   188| * Build the strict execution answer from a completed worker-queue job result.
   189| *
   190| * This is the chat-side renderer for jobs created via the persistent worker
   191| * queue (`enqueueOrAttachSeniorDeveloperJob`). It mirrors the runtime-proof
   192| * renderer above but reads from the secret-safe `IVXWorkerJobResult` summary
   193| * that the worker writes to the durable proof ledger. It never fabricates
   194| * evidence: if a field is missing it surfaces the exact honest line.
   195| */
   196|export function buildSeniorDeveloperWorkerJobAnswer(
   197|  job: IVXWorkerJob,
   198|  decision: IVXOwnerExecutionDecision,
   199|): string {
   200|  const result = job.result;
   201|  const guarded = decision.requiresApproval;
